        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "817612cb-958b-589a-9f46-580d78a712a2",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Anaïs Lameche, Darren Hayes, Anna Sundstrand, Faye Hamlin, Rosie Munter\n- Organizations: Play\n- Products: Playin' Around, Replay\n- Places: French Alps, France\n- Topics: music careers, concert and studio footage\n\nFacts:\n- Darren Hayes was born on 8 May 1972 and is an Australian singer-songwriter, comedian, and podcaster.\n- Anaïs Helena Lameche Bonnier, née Kretz Lameche, was born on 19 August 1987 in the French Alps, France.\n- Anaïs Lameche is a former Swedish pop singer and an original member of the Swedish pop group Play.\n- Playin' Around, also known as \"Playin' Around the World,\" contains about an hour of video segments featuring Play members Anaïs Lameche, Anna Sundstrand, Faye Hamlin, and Rosie Munter.\n- In Playin' Around, the members of Play perform songs in concert, rehearse music videos, discuss life performing and living on their tour bus, and record tracks in the studio to prepare for their album \"Replay\".",
